Two!

19:56.130 --> 19:57.550
One!

20:03.260 --> 20:05.640
Happy New Year!

20:06.180 --> 20:07.770
Congratulations, everyone.

20:08.270 --> 20:10.690
Thank you for everything!

20:12.730 --> 20:17.740
Okay, here's the first song
of the new year! Let's go!

20:19.360 --> 20:21.910
"Superorbital"!

20:46.850 --> 20:50.980
Kizukanai furi shiteta bokura wa
Though we pretended not to notice

20:51.980 --> 20:56.020
Hanarebanare no hoshi nagamete
We gaze at the faraway stairs

20:57.610 --> 21:01.740
Kiseki o ima okoshitagatteru
Spread your wings and fly off

21:02.780 --> 21:04.570
Chigau sekai e
Toward another world

21:05.530 --> 21:09.500
Tsubasa o hiroge, tobitate
That now wants to cause a miracle

21:10.000 --> 21:12.120
Mou mayowanai No more hesitation

21:12.710 --> 21:14.960
Hanarete itemo
Even if we're apart

21:15.500 --> 21:20.550
Kanjiteru kara susumu yo
I feel you, so I'll carry on

21:21.800 --> 21:27.470
Egaki, kakedashita sora ima kiraari The sky that has
begun to take shape, to dash forward, now sparkles

21:27.760 --> 21:30.679
