21:30.680 --> 21:32.600
Hoshi o koete
That set out toward you

21:32.810 --> 21:35.900
Hirogeta te no hira kazashita
Outstretched palms, holding up

21:36.190 --> 21:37.940
Hoshi no iro
The color of the stars

21:38.690 --> 21:40.570
Deaeta kiseki Toward a tomorrow

21:41.360 --> 21:45.320
Kasaneau ashita e
Where our paths have overlapped

21:47.280 --> 21:49.410
It's a new year!

21:55.170 --> 21:59.130
Aitai! Kokoro o tsunagu bokura wa
I miss you! Our hearts are joined

22:00.050 --> 22:04.260
Hikaru niji no kanata miagete
We look up, beyond the shining rainbow

22:06.010 --> 22:09.970
Kiseki ga michi kagayaiteiru
Miracles are brimming, shining

22:11.020 --> 22:12.600
Sonna sekai e
Toward a world like that

22:13.600 --> 22:17.650
Kimi to te tsunaide tobitate
I clasp your hand and fly off

22:18.150 --> 22:20.230
Massugu susumou
Let's go straight forward

22:20.860 --> 22:25.900
Kimi no kokoro kanjiteru kara
Because I feel your heart

22:26.360 --> 22:28.820
Kakedasou!
Let's charge forth!

22:29.870 --> 22:35.540
Futari tobidashita sora ima kiraari The
sky toward which we flew off now sparkles

22:35.910 --> 22:40.710
Kimi to boku o sono se ni hikari koete You
and I turn our backs to it, faster than light

22:41.050 --> 22:44.010
Tsunaida te to te mitsumeta
To the ends of the sky

22:44.260 --> 22:46.180
Sora no hate
We stared at it, hand in hand

22:46.720 --> 22:48.760
Hitomi o tojite Close your eyes

22:49.550 --> 22:53.430
Kokoro o ima kasanete
Let our hearts now overlap

23:13.580 --> 23:19.120
Egaki, kakedashita sora ima kiraari The sky that has
begun to take shape, to dash forward, now sparkles

23:19.540 --> 23:21.459
Kimi o mezashi tabi o shita
Beyond the stars

23:21.460 --> 23:22.499
I'm gonna be late!

23:22.500 --> 23:24.380
Hoshi o koete
That set out toward you

23:24.381 --> 23:25.800
I-I'll be back!

23:24.800 --> 23:27.800
Hirogeta te no hira kazashita
Outstretched palms, holding up

